      *--- PARMS FOR CALL TO 'CRESERVE', WHICH WILL ADD, DELETE         CRESERVE
      *-- OR MODIFY RESERVATIONS OF CORPORATE CODES FOR EITHER          CRESERVE
      *-- WORKORDERS OR STOREROOM WORKSHEETS.                           CRESERVE
       01  RESERVATION-DATA.                                            CRESERVE
           05  RESERVE-TYPE              PIC X(2).                      CRESERVE
           05  R-RET-CODE                PIC X(2).                      CRESERVE
           05  RESERVATION-RSV-DATA.                                    CRESERVE
               10  R-CORP-CODE           PIC X(10).                     CRESERVE
               10  R-WONO                PIC X(12).                     CRESERVE
               10  R-QTY                 PIC S9(8).                     CRESERVE
               10  R-MACH                PIC X(8).                      CRESERVE
               10  R-MACH-SUB            PIC X(4).                      CRESERVE
               10  R-STAGE-LOC           PIC X(4).                      CRESERVE
               10  R-USE-DEPT            PIC X(6).                      CRESERVE
               10  R-DATE-CN.                                           CRESERVE
                   15  R-DATE-CC         PIC X(2).                      CRESERVE
                   15  R-DATE.                                          CRESERVE
                       20  R-DATE-YY     PIC X(2).                      CRESERVE
                       20  FILLER        PIC X(4).                      CRESERVE
               10  R-WO-ITEM             PIC X(4).                      CRESERVE
       01  R-MESSAGE                     PIC X(72).                     CRESERVE
                                                                        CRESERVE
